  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Ta có \n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tSuy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>500</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>400</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Hệ thống rađa bắt được tín hiệu của máy bay trong khoảng thời gian là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>600</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math> giờ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow></semantics></math> phút.",
